    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks! I noticed that several times, but forgot to add (as I did not experience any issues during the transition from `master` to `main`). Sorry you had to figure it out on your own.\r\n\r\nThis should now be fixed on latest `main` with a more broad statement about 'nvim-treesitter' requirements.",
